cones(ZZ,TropicalCycle) -- computes the cones of a tropical cycle
*****************************************************************

  * Function: *note cones: (Polyhedra)cones,
  * Usage: 
        cones(k,T)
  * Inputs:
      * k, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, 
      * T, a *note tropical cycle: TropicalCycle,, 
  * Outputs:
      * L, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, the cones of codimension k in T 

Description
===========

This function computes the cone of codimension k of the fan associated to the
tropical cycle T.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : QQ[x,y,z,w,t]                                                           |
|                                                                             |
|o1 = QQ[x..z, w, t]                                                          |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : PolynomialRing                                                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : I=ideal(x^2-y*z+w^2,w^3-y^3*x+z^3,t-w+x);                               |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : Ideal of QQ[x..z, w, t]                                                 |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : T=tropicalVariety I;                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : cones(2,T)                                                              |
|                                                                             |
|o4 = {{0, 1}, {0, 2}, {0, 3}, {0, 6}, {1, 4}, {1, 5}, {2, 4}, {2, 5}, {3, 4},|
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|     {3, 5}, {4, 6}, {5, 6}}                                                 |
|                                                                             |
|o4 : List                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

Ways to use this method:
========================

  * *note cones(ZZ,TropicalCycle): cones_lpZZ_cmTropicalCycle_rp, -- computes
    the cones of a tropical cycle
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

