fan(TropicalCycle) -- outputs the fan associated to the tropical cycle
**********************************************************************

  * Function: *note fan: (Polyhedra)fan,
  * Usage: 
        fan(T)
  * Inputs:
      * T, a *note tropical cycle: TropicalCycle,, 
  * Outputs:
      * F, an instance of the type *note Fan: (Polyhedra)Fan,, the fan
        associated to the tropical cycle T

Description
===========

This function outputs the fan associated to the tropical cycle T.

+-----------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : QQ[x,y,z]                                       |
|                                                     |
|o1 = QQ[x..z]                                        |
|                                                     |
|o1 : PolynomialRing                                  |
+-----------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : T=tropicalVariety (ideal(x+3*y+3));             |
+-----------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : fan T                                           |
|                                                     |
|o3 = Fan{...1...}                                    |
|                                                     |
|o3 : Fan                                             |
+-----------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : peek o3#cache                                   |
|                                                     |
|o4 = CacheTable{computedDimension => 2              }|
|                computedFVector => {0, 1, 3}         |
|                computedLinealityBasis => | 0 |      |
|                                          | 0 |      |
|                                          | 1 |      |
|                generatingObjects => {{0}, {1}, {2}} |
|                inputCones => {{2}, {0}, {1}}        |
|                inputRays => | 3 0 -3 |              |
|                             | 0 3 -3 |              |
|                             | 1 1 -2 |              |
|                pure => true                         |
|                rays => | -3 3 0 |                   |
|                        | -3 0 3 |                   |
|                        | -2 1 1 |                   |
|                simplicial => true                   |
+-----------------------------------------------------+

Ways to use this method:
========================

  * *note fan(TropicalCycle): fan_lpTropicalCycle_rp, -- outputs the fan
    associated to the tropical cycle
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

