        isPure(T)
  * Inputs:
      * T, a *note tropical cycle: TropicalCycle,, 
  * Outputs:
      * B, a *note Boolean value: (Macaulay2Doc)Boolean,,  

Description
===========

This function checks whether the fan associated to the tropical cycle is pure,
i.e. if the maximal cones have all the same dimension.

+-------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : F=fan ({posHull(matrix{{1,2,3},{0,2,0}}),posHull(matrix{{0},{1}})});|
+-------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : T=tropicalCycle (F,{1,2});                                          |
+-------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : isPure T                                                            |
|                                                                         |
|o3 = false                                                               |
+-------------------------------------------------------------------------+

