TropicalCycle -- a Type for working with tropical cycles
********************************************************

Description
===========

This is the main type for tropical cycles. A TropicalCycle consists of a Fan
with an extra HashKey Multiplicities, which is the list of multiplicities on
the maximal cones listed in the order that the maximal cones appear in the
MaxCones list. A TropicalCycle is saved as a hash table which contains the Fan
and the Multiplicities.



Functions and methods returning a tropical cycle:
=================================================

  * *note stableIntersection: stableIntersection, -- computes the stable
    intersection of two tropical varieties
  * *note tropicalCycle: tropicalCycle, -- constructs a TropicalCycle from a
    Fan and a list with multiplicities
  * *note tropicalVariety: tropicalVariety, -- the tropical variety associated
    to an ideal

Methods that use a tropical cycle:
==================================

  * *note ambDim(TropicalCycle): ambDim_lpTropicalCycle_rp, -- computes the
    dimension of the ambient space of a tropical cycle
  * *note cones(ZZ,TropicalCycle): cones_lpZZ_cmTropicalCycle_rp, -- computes
    the cones of a tropical cycle
  * *note dim(TropicalCycle): dim_lpTropicalCycle_rp, -- computes the dimension
    of a tropical cycle
  * *note fan(TropicalCycle): fan_lpTropicalCycle_rp, -- outputs the fan
    associated to the tropical cycle
  * *note fVector(TropicalCycle): fVector_lpTropicalCycle_rp, -- computes the
    fVector of  a  tropical cycle
  * "isBalanced(TropicalCycle)" -- see *note isBalanced: isBalanced, -- checks
    whether a tropical cycle is balanced
  * *note isPure(TropicalCycle): isPure_lpTropicalCycle_rp, -- checks whether
    a tropical cycle is pure
  * *note isSimplicial(TropicalCycle): isSimplicial_lpTropicalCycle_rp, --
    checks whether a tropical cycle is simplicial
  * *note linealitySpace(TropicalCycle): linealitySpace_lpTropicalCycle_rp, --
    computes the lineality space of a  tropical cycle
  * *note maxCones(TropicalCycle): maxCones_lpTropicalCycle_rp, -- computes the
    maximal cone of a tropical cycle
  * "multiplicities(TropicalCycle)" -- see *note multiplicities:
    multiplicities, -- returns the list of multiplicities on maximal cones in a
    tropical cycle
  * *note rays(TropicalCycle): rays_lpTropicalCycle_rp, -- computes the rays of
    a tropical cycle
  * "stableIntersection(TropicalCycle,TropicalCycle)" -- see *note
    stableIntersection: stableIntersection, -- computes the stable intersection
    of two tropical varieties
  * star(TropicalCycle,Polyhedron) (missing documentation)

