tropicalPrevariety -- the intersection of the tropical hypersurfaces
********************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        tropicalPrevariety(L)
        tropicalPrevariaty(L,LS)
        tropicalPrevariety(L,Strategy=>S)
        tropicalPrevariety(L,LS,Strategy=>S)
  * Inputs:
      * L, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, of polynomials
      * LS, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, of Symmetries (optional)
  * *note Optional inputs: (Macaulay2Doc)using functions with optional inputs,:
      * Strategy => a *note string: (Macaulay2Doc)String,, default value
        "gfan", Strategy (currently only "gfan")
  * Outputs:
      * F, an instance of the type *note Fan: (Polyhedra)Fan,, the intersection
        of the tropical hypersurfaces of polynomials in L

Description
===========

This method intersects the tropical hypersurfaces coming from the
tropicalizations of the polynomials in the list L. If there are symmetries that
leave the specified polynomials fixed, they can  be specified by passing a list
with the symmetries as second argument, with the same format as the option
*note Symmetry: Symmetry,.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : QQ[x_1,x_2,x_3,x_4]                                                     |
|                                                                             |
|o1 = QQ[x ..x ]                                                              |
|         1   4                                                               |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : PolynomialRing                                                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : L={x_1+x_2+x_3+x_4,x_1*x_2+x_2*x_3+x_3*x_4+x_4*x_1,x_1*x_2*x_3+x_2*x_3*x|
|                                                                             |
|o2 = {x  + x  + x  + x , x x  + x x  + x x  + x x , x x x  + x x x  + x x x  |
|       1    2    3    4   1 2    2 3    1 4    3 4   1 2 3    1 2 4    1 3 4 |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|     + x x x , x x x x  - 1}                                                 |
|        2 3 4   1 2 3 4                                                      |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : List                                                                    |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|_4+x_3*x_4*x_1+x_4*x_1*x_2,x_1*x_2*x_3*x_4-1}                                |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : tropicalPrevariety L                                                    |
|                                                                             |
|o3 = Fan{...1...}                                                            |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : Fan                                                                     |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : QQ[x_0,x_1]                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|o4 = QQ[x ..x ]                                                              |
|         0   1                                                               |
|                                                                             |
|o4 : PolynomialRing                                                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : tropicalPrevariety({x_0+x_1+1}, {{1,0}})                                |
|                                                                             |
|o5 = Fan{...1...}                                                            |
|                                                                             |
|o5 : Fan                                                                     |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : QQ[x_0,x_1]                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|o6 = QQ[x ..x ]                                                              |
|         0   1                                                               |
|                                                                             |
|o6 : PolynomialRing                                                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : tropicalPrevariety({x_0+x_1+1,x_0+x_1},Strategy => "gfan")              |
|                                                                             |
|o7 = Fan{...1...}                                                            |
|                                                                             |
|o7 : Fan                                                                     |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

