|                                                                    |
|                         2                                          |
|o2 = 2x*y + x*z + y*z + z                                           |
|                                                                    |
|o2 : R                                                              |
+--------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : f=2*x^2+x*y+2*y^2+x*z+y*z+2*z^2                                |
|                                                                    |
|       2           2                 2                              |
